  "details": "新しいUIがとにかく使いづらいです。インスタンス内のユーザーの名前が全員白色で表示されるため、フレンドの把握が難しく不便です。スタイリッシュなデザイン故に、直感的な理解がしづらいです。以前のUIのデザインを維持してほしいです。UIを変更しないでください。\n\nThe new UI is extremely difficult to use. Since every user's name in the instance is displayed in white, it's hard to identify my friends, which is very inconvenient. While the new design looks stylish, it makes the interface less intuitive and harder to understand at a glance. I would like the previous UI design to be kept. Please do not change the UI.",
